\begin_layout Section
Genomic selection for single phenotype
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
To run the GS pipeline for a single phenotype, the package has the 
\series bold
gs_single
\series default
 function that uses two parameters: a configuration file name with the GS
 parameters (YAML format) and an output directory name where the results
 will be saved.
 
\end_layout

